//
// `names` (0.2.5) holds the same other-language set data/names.js stores per
// species, from ability_names.csv. A language with no row is omitted —
// ability_names.csv has NO roomaji rows at all, so no ability carries
// `jaRomaji`. Data only: the detail screen's name popup is species-only and
// does not read this.

